  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The person is mapped as 'cute' by the text",
  "description": "The text 'i'm cute' is overlaid on the image of the person with developmental disability, creating an analogical mapping where the person is being represented as 'cute'. This mapping infantilizes the person by reducing her identity to a superficial, childlike aesthetic, which is a form of ableist infantilization. The text explicitly assigns the attribute 'cute' to the visual entity, thereby projecting the textual concept onto the person's visual representation.",
